  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Corredores Viales Nacionales</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Road Corridors</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">INVESTMENTS TO IMPROVE ROAD TRANSPORT CORRIDORS CONNECTING THE MOST IMPORTANT AREAS OF PRODUCTION WITH SEA AND RIVER PORTS AND BORDER CROSSINGS, REDUCING TRANSPORT COSTS, FACILITATING THE EXPANSION OF EXPORTS AND INTEGRATION WITH OTHER &quot;MERCOSUR&quot; COUNTRIES. THE PROGRAM INCLUDES A COMPONENT FOR TECHNICAL AND MANAGEMENT STRENGTHENING OF THE NATIONAL ROADS DIRECTORATE (DNV).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
